&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite is a global industrial Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company enabling the full-scale digital transformation of heavy-asset industries. Our core software product, Cognite Data Fusion (CDF), powers companies with contextualized OT/IT data to develop and scale solutions that increase safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency while driving revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Director within our Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Cognite’s growth by winning new Supply Chain business within accounts headquartered in your territory. Operating as a subject matter expert, you will leverage deep domain insights to help customers transform their supply chain value chain using Cognite Applications and the Cognite Data Fusion Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory &amp;amp; CoE Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a targeted territory strategy to accelerate bookings growth and secure high-impact supply chain clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively prospect and leverage your personal network to generate pipeline, providing compelling &quot;commercial insights&quot; on optimizing the supply chain value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead extended territory teams (including pre-sales and technical experts) through complex enterprise sales cycles to exceed bookings targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Quantify ROI and present strong business cases to help enterprise executives justify software investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; work with partners to qualify and progress their pipeline, and drive joint engagements on qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account / Engagement Leader in negotiating favorable pricing and commercial terms with C-level executives by demonstrating the long-term strategic value of Cognite’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal Product Management and Marketing teams to feed real-market supply chain insights back into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Hygiene &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account Leaders and their First Line Managers in accurately forecasting monthly/quarterly bookings and maintaining up-to-date account records in &lt;a href=&quot;http://salesforce.com&quot;&gt;Salesforce.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, Abilities (KSAs) &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain expertise in complex Supply Chain operations for Energy, Manufacturing or Power Utilities verticals. Understanding of Production operations and industry x.0 initiatives is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to sell value and build quantified ROI frameworks for prospective buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informal Leadership, Influence &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of self-motivation, time management, and ability to informally lead and effectively influence cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Stellar presentation, written, and verbal communication skills tailored for C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Software/SaaS:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven mastery of selling complex analytics or data platforms (e.g., AI, Big Data, Data Warehousing, Business Intelligence, Machine Learning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern data architectures and tools, such as Big Data frameworks (Hadoop, Spark, Hive, BigQuery), Data Warehouses, and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in the Manufacturing and broader industrial supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of direct or in-support sales experience, selling enterprise software/SaaS (BI, Big Data, Advanced Analytics, or AI/ML) to C-level executives, Management and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding SaaS bookings goals in direct / partner / channel-based sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience operating in high-growth startup environments (Series A, B, or C stage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Great &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values:&lt;/strong&gt; High autonomy, a culture of speed and openness, social and diversity initiatives (Together@Cognite), and a commitment to innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base + variable compensation, 401(k) employer matching, fully covered health/dental/vision/disability premiums, and learning stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited PTO, paid parental leave, and catered company lunches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #666e99;&quot;&gt;Why Cognite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve problems that actually matter at scale — not hypothetical ones. You&#39;ll join a collaborative, fast-moving environment where curiosity and ownership are the norm, not the exception. If you want delivery work you can point to and be proud of, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK (field-based, in branches every week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial, will report to UK General Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive compensation + bonus + car allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dwelly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dwelly is building the AI operating system for residential lettings. Its growing network of agencies provides its AI with real-world data, continuous feedback, and control over complete workflows, making exceptional service the standard for landlords and tenants. Today, Dwelly operates more than 15,000 properties and $470 million in GMV, making it one of the UK’s ten largest lettings operators. The company has raised $263 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a fast-growing, product-focused company, backed by top-tier investors and led by a team with deep experience in real estate, technology, and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Area Director you lead the Client Directors of up to 10 geographically close Dwelly branches, covering 4,000 to 7,000 managed properties, and report to the UK General Manager. You own the area&#39;s growth and profit. You set a number for every Client Director, run a weekly sales cadence to hit it, and close the gap between your best and weakest branch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be in branches every week, working with Client Directors, valuers and our central team, and you will integrate newly acquired agencies into your area as Dwelly grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales performance and cadence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a number for every Client Director and run the cadence to hit it: daily pipeline check, weekly 1:1s, a weekly area pipeline call, and a monthly forecast and branch league table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the gap between your best and weakest branch, measured on lead-to-instruction conversion by branch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Landlord relationships and key accounts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win and keep the big landlords: hold the key accounts and lead the negotiations, measured on revenue per property and landlord churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People and coaching&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach on the floor by joining valuations and landlord meetings, and sharpen the pitch and the fee conversation. Hire, develop and, where needed, move on Client Directors and valuers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial discipline and growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep fees, pricing and upsell consistent in every branch, and deliver on new properties signed, net portfolio growth and area EBITDA. Integrate newly acquired agencies into your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of running several branches, or a large team, at a sales-led, high-volume agency and beating targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sales cycle you have built and tracked: pipeline, forecast, conversion and a weekly rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing managers to a number.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lettings knowledge, commercial judgement on fees and pricing, and P&amp;amp;L literacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The presence to win over senior landlords and lead people who sell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English, and the judgment to make good decisions quickly with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet most of the must-haves and are excited by the role, please apply. We hire for ability and trajectory, not a perfect match to a list.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, based on your skills and experience, plus a bonus that is uncapped on new properties signed above target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Car allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; included in the package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and progression:&lt;/strong&gt; real ownership of an area, with the data to run it and a central team to support you, and a path to Regional Director as Dwelly grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock options:&lt;/strong&gt; we offer stock options, so you can share in Dwelly’s long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and culture:&lt;/strong&gt; A closely connected international team, with regular get-togethers and company-funded social events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re solving one of the most complex problems in the largest consumer industry there is: residential rentals. We work hard, set ambitious goals and give people real ownership, so that you can look back and say &quot;I built that&quot;. Our principles guide how we make decisions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsession&lt;/strong&gt; rather than competitor focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion for invention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-term thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docsend.com/view/7v8gwrjaky7mn895&quot;&gt;Dwelly Core Principles&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to complete the process at pace and will keep you updated at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First interview&lt;/strong&gt; with our Talent team (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring manager interview&lt;/strong&gt; (45 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive interview with Director of Launch&lt;/strong&gt; (45 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder interview &lt;/strong&gt;(30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business case:&lt;/strong&gt; a practical exercise based on a real problem from the role (60 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on preparation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hiring process is comprehensive, because we’re still small enough that every person we hire shapes our culture and our results. Two stages need some preparation from you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business case:&lt;/strong&gt; a practical exercise based on a real challenge from the role. It’s the best way for you to show us how you work, not just tell us, and for you to see the problems you’d be solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder interview:&lt;/strong&gt; a conversation with one of our founders about your motivation, judgment and how you approach problems. Come ready to talk about your thinking, not only your CV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll share clear guidance ahead of both. Candidates who prepare well tend to enjoy these stages most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dwelly is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from all backgrounds and make hiring decisions based on skills, experience and potential. We value different perspectives and are committed to building a team where everyone feels respected and included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;556&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;By applying for this position, you consent to the processing and storage of your personal data for recruitment purposes for up to 365 days, in accordance with our data retention policy and applicable data protection laws.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Data, AI, Solutions and Engineering practice are looking for an experienced Data Architecture Manager/Senior Manager to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are looking for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;a data architecture manager/senior manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt; to join our growing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;Data, AI, Solutions &amp;amp; Engineering practice. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join an exciting, growing team but with the backing of a much larger and more established business. You will have the opportunity to work on a wide range of exciting and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;all whilst playing an integral role in growing our data practice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW79726546 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You will be using your experience to help our clients solve their most important data challenges.  You would be also responsible to support the growth of our team, helping them to build the skills they need to solve our client’s challenges. Depending on the level, you can be a part of our leadership team, shaping the direction of the practice, growing the business and leading our people. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Typical engagements include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Designing target data architectures (both on premise, cloud or hybrid options) such as cloud data warehouses, data lakes, lakehouses and data platforms, together with the migration and transition architecture needed to get there, including compliance with the organisation’s strategy, policies and standards and, in some cases, helping clients to define new policies, principles and standards&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;26&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Making technology recommendations and producing reference architectures for engineering teams, capturing key design choices in Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) and advising clients through objective, vendor-neutral assessment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;31&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Owning and leading the architecture through delivery, guiding &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;engineering and product teams to translate designs into implementable solutions, resolve design questions and ensure delivery remains aligned to the intended architecture and outcome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
