&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Backend Engineer – Java&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) |&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect the next generation of financial platforms. Lead with Java expertise. Deliver impact at scale.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Principal Backend Engineer (Java) to lead the architecture, design and delivery of secure, scalable, cloud-native platforms for global financial services clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take ownership of complex engineering challenges, influence technical direction and shape the standards that underpin high-performing backend systems. You&#39;ll combine deep Java engineering expertise with strong architectural judgement, a security-first mindset and the ability to guide engineering teams through critical technical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with Tier 1 financial institutions, you&#39;ll challenge assumptions constructively, balance architectural trade-offs and ensure solutions deliver lasting value through reliability, performance, security and maintainability. You&#39;ll also play a key role in developing engineering talent, promoting technical excellence and strengthening Capco&#39;s engineering capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead backend architecture and engineering delivery, designing and developing secure, scalable cloud-native applications using Java 11+ and Spring Boot, while taking ownership of technical quality, reliability and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect distributed systems and cloud solutions, guiding the development of microservices and event-driven architectures on public cloud platforms, preferably AWS, and making informed decisions across performance, resilience, security and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape technical strategy and engineering decisions, constructively challenging architectural approaches, evaluating technical risks and trade-offs, and aligning engineering solutions with enterprise strategies and measurable client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion engineering excellence and responsible innovation, embedding test-first development, automated quality controls and continuous improvement. Where appropriate, use approved AI-assisted engineering tools to support code analysis, test generation and technical documentation, with human validation, security safeguards and established governance controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop engineering teams, mentoring developers, guiding delivery processes, strengthening engineering standards and influencing technical practices across Capco to deliver consistent, high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven principal-level engineering capability, with experience leading the design and delivery of complex, enterprise-grade backend systems and establishing high standards for software quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural judgement, with the ability to assess complex technical challenges, evaluate competing approaches and make informed decisions across security, scalability, reliability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A security-first engineering mindset, with experience identifying technical risks, embedding appropriate controls and ensuring security considerations inform architecture and delivery decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership, including the ability to manage, mentor and develop engineering teams, influence technical strategy and guide decisions across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and commercially aware approach, with the confidence to challenge assumptions constructively, communicate complex technical decisions clearly and connect engineering priorities to client objectives and practical business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep hands-on expertise and architectural experience across the following essential technologies and engineering practices:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java &amp;amp; Spring Boot: Expertise in Java 11/17+ and Spring Boot, with extensive experience designing, developing and delivering enterprise-grade backend applications and AWS-based cloud solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microservices &amp;amp; Distributed Architecture: Proven experience architecting secure, scalable services using microservices and CQRS patterns, including distributed and event-driven system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD, Data &amp;amp; Messaging: Strong experience with CI/CD pipelines, SQL and NoSQL databases, Kafka, CloudFormation and streaming frameworks, supporting reliable enterprise software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Engineering: Advanced understanding of system security protocols and controls, including OAuth, Identity and Access Management (IAM), TLS and encryption, with the ability to apply security-first principles to backend architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: Demonstrated capability to manage and mentor engineering teams, lead technical decision-making, establish engineering standards and drive technology strategy across complex delivery environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to thought leadership, mentoring initiatives or Requests for Proposal (RFPs) within consulting or technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GitLab CI/CD, Cucumber and Behaviour Driven Design (BDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect certification (Associate or Professional).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of delivering large-scale, customer-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for experimenting with emerging tools, technologies and approaches within backend engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Your growth, your way - minimum 40 Hours of Training Annually. Take your pick; workshops, certifications, e-learning. Also, Business Coach assigned from Day One: Get one-on-one guidance to fast-track your goals and accelerate your development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our &lt;strong&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/strong&gt; culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
